Tacit: WithTacitEncoder(useBP = false).

Makes the branch predictor a fragment parameter and defaults it OFF, which
flips the stock default (the predictor is unused unless software selects
BrPredict mode, and costs ~3k LUT per encoder). Carried to keep RiskyBird's
Tacit shells as built; whether upstream should default it off is open.

